---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AI Automation Services | AuditVerse AI"
  description="Enterprise AI Automation: Finance Bots, Audit Bots, HR Bots, Document AI, Invoice AI, OCR and workflow automation for finance and operations teams."
  canonical="https://www.auditverseai.com/ai-automation"
  activePage="ai-automation"
>

<section class="page-hero on-dark">
  <div class="hero-grid-lines"></div>
  <div class="wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:2;">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--white)">AI Automation</span></div>
    <div class="eyebrow">AI Automation</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(32px,4.6vw,54px);font-weight:800;max-width:820px;color:var(--white);line-height:1.1;">AI Automation that runs your back office like a control tower</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:20px;">From finance bots to document AI, AuditVerse AI designs and deploys enterprise-grade automation across finance, HR, procurement, logistics and operations — with full audit trails built in.</p>
    <div class="badge-row" style="margin-top:26px;"><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Finance Bots</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Document AI</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Workflow Automation</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>24/7 Monitoring</span></div>
    
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">Enterprise Software, Not Scripts</div>
      <h2 class="headline">Automation built like software, governed like an audit</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px;">Most 'automation' projects are brittle scripts that break the moment a vendor changes an invoice template. We build AI Bots as enterprise software — versioned, monitored, and reviewed by Chartered Accountants for control integrity.</p><p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px;">Every bot logs what it did, why, and what exception it raised — so your external auditors trust the automation as much as your finance team does.</p>
      <ul class="list-check" style="margin-top:24px;"><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Deploy in weeks, not quarters — modular bots go live independently</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Full exception logging and human-in-the-loop review for every automated decision</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Integrates with Odoo, SAP, NetSuite, QuickBooks, Zoho and custom systems</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="img-frame reveal">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1620712943543-95508732b21b?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="AI Automation that runs your back office like a control tower" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Capabilities</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Explore what we automate</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="tabs-nav" data-group="ai-automation"><button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="bots">AI Bots</button><button class="tab-btn " data-tab="docai">Document &amp; Invoice AI</button><button class="tab-btn " data-tab="workflow">Workflow Automation</button></div>
    
      <div class="tab-panel active" data-group="ai-automation" data-tab="bots">
        
          <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M4 2h16v20l-3-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-3-2Z"/><path d="M8 7h8"/><path d="M8 11h8"/><path d="M8 15h5"/></svg></div><h4>Finance Bot</h4><p>Automates journal entries, month-end accruals and bank reconciliation, flagging exceptions for human review instead of burying them in spreadsheets.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9 8 11 4.6-2 8-6 8-11V5Z"/></svg></div><h4>Audit Bot</h4><p>Continuously samples transactions against your control framework and raises risk-scored exceptions before your year-end audit ever starts.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H7a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="10" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9"/><path d="M16 3.1a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.8"/></svg></div><h4>HR Bot</h4><p>Handles onboarding paperwork, leave approvals and payroll input validation, routing exceptions to HR only when judgment is required.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M4 2h16v20l-3-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-3-2Z"/><path d="M8 7h8"/><path d="M8 11h8"/><path d="M8 15h5"/></svg></div><h4>Payroll Bot</h4><p>Cross-checks attendance, overtime and statutory deductions automatically before every pay run, cutting payroll errors close to zero.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="1" y="6" width="14" height="11"/><path d="M15 9h4l3 4v4h-7"/><circle cx="6" cy="19" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="19" r="2"/></svg></div><h4>Procurement Bot</h4><p>Matches purchase orders, goods-received notes and vendor invoices automatically — the classic 3-way match, done in seconds not days.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="m16.5 9.4-9-5.19"/><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z"/><path d="M3.3 7 12 12l8.7-5"/><path d="M12 22V12"/></svg></div><h4>Inventory Bot</h4><p>Monitors stock movement, flags slow-moving or at-risk inventory, and reconciles physical counts against system records.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="m3 17 6-6 4 4 8-8"/><path d="M15 7h6v6"/></svg></div><h4>Sales Bot</h4><p>Tracks order-to-cash, ageing receivables and customer credit limits, nudging collections before invoices go overdue.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 .3 1.9l.1.1a2 2 0 1 1-2.8 2.8l-.1-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.9-.3 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1 1.5V21a2 2 0 1 1-4 0v-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1-1.6 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.9.3l-.1.1a2 2 0 1 1-2.8-2.8l.1-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 .3-1.9 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.5-1H3a2 2 0 1 1 0-4h.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.6-1 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-.3-1.9l-.1-.1a2 2 0 1 1 2.8-2.8l.1.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.9.3H9a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1-1.5V3a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1 1.5 1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.9-.3l.1-.1a2 2 0 1 1 2.8 2.8l-.1.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-.3 1.9V9a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.5 1H21a2 2 0 1 1 0 4h-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.5 1Z"/></svg></div><h4>Operations Bot</h4><p>Coordinates cross-department workflows — from fleet dispatch to production scheduling — with a single automated task queue.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><rect x="7" y="12" width="3" height="6"/><rect x="12" y="8" width="3" height="10"/><rect x="17" y="5" width="3" height="13"/></svg></div><h4>Dashboard Bot</h4><p>Refreshes your BI dashboards automatically and pushes daily digest summaries to leadership inboxes.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/></svg></div><h4>CEO Assistant Bot</h4><p>A conversational summary layer over your entire data stack — ask it for cash position, top risks or department performance in plain language.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="m12 2 9 5-9 5-9-5Z"/><path d="m3 12 9 5 9-5"/><path d="m3 17 9 5 9-5"/></svg></div><h4>Management Reporting Bot</h4><p>Auto-generates board packs, variance commentary and KPI scorecards from live ERP and BI data.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M9 2v3"/><path d="M15 2v3"/><path d="M9 19v3"/><path d="M15 19v3"/><path d="M2 9h3"/><path d="M2 15h3"/><path d="M19 9h3"/><path d="M19 15h3"/></svg></div><h4>ChatGPT Enterprise Integration</h4><p>Securely connects enterprise LLMs to your internal data for policy Q&amp;A, drafting and analysis — governed by role-based access.</p></div>
          </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tab-panel " data-group="ai-automation" data-tab="docai">
        
          <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/><path d="M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"/><path d="M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"/><path d="M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2"/><path d="M7 12h10"/></svg></div><h4>Document AI</h4><p>Reads contracts, statements and correspondence, extracting structured data into your ERP without manual re-keying.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M4 2h16v20l-3-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-3-2Z"/><path d="M8 7h8"/><path d="M8 11h8"/><path d="M8 15h5"/></svg></div><h4>Invoice AI</h4><p>Captures line-item detail from any invoice format — PDF, scan or email — and posts it directly into your accounting system.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/><path d="M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"/><path d="M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"/><path d="M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2"/><path d="M7 12h10"/></svg></div><h4>OCR AI</h4><p>High-accuracy optical character recognition tuned for financial documents: multi-currency, multi-language, multi-format.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8Z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h4>Approval AI</h4><p>Routes documents through configurable approval chains, learning your organisation's escalation patterns over time.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M9 2v3"/><path d="M15 2v3"/><path d="M9 19v3"/><path d="M15 19v3"/><path d="M2 9h3"/><path d="M2 15h3"/><path d="M19 9h3"/><path d="M19 15h3"/></svg></div><h4>ERP AI Assistant</h4><p>An embedded assistant inside your ERP that answers "why" a number changed — not just "what" it is.</p></div>
          </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tab-panel " data-group="ai-automation" data-tab="workflow">
        
          <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="3" y="3" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/><rect x="15" y="15" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/><path d="M9 6h6a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v6"/></svg></div><h4>Approval Workflow Automation</h4><p>Multi-level, conditional approval chains for expenses, purchase orders and contracts — fully auditable.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="1" y="6" width="14" height="11"/><path d="M15 9h4l3 4v4h-7"/><circle cx="6" cy="19" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="19" r="2"/></svg></div><h4>Logistics &amp; Fleet Automation</h4><p>Automated dispatch scheduling, fuel reconciliation and maintenance alerts across your vehicle fleet.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="m16.5 9.4-9-5.19"/><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z"/><path d="M3.3 7 12 12l8.7-5"/><path d="M12 22V12"/></svg></div><h4>Procurement Automation</h4><p>From requisition to purchase order, vendor selection and payment — a fully digitised procure-to-pay cycle.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H7a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="10" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9"/><path d="M16 3.1a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.8"/></svg></div><h4>HR Automation</h4><p>Recruitment pipelines, onboarding checklists and performance review cycles running on autopilot.</p></div>
          </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Benefits</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Why this matters for your bottom line</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-4">
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg></div><h4>Time Saving</h4><p>Cut manual processing time by up to 80% across invoicing, payroll and reconciliation.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><rect x="7" y="12" width="3" height="6"/><rect x="12" y="8" width="3" height="10"/><rect x="17" y="5" width="3" height="13"/></svg></div><h4>Cost Reduction</h4><p>Redeploy headcount from data entry to analysis — reducing operating cost per transaction.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div><h4>Accuracy</h4><p>AI-driven matching eliminates the transposition and duplication errors manual entry creates.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9 8 11 4.6-2 8-6 8-11V5Z"/></svg></div><h4>Fraud Detection</h4><p>Pattern-based anomaly detection flags unusual transactions in real time, not at year-end.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">How We Deliver</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Our engagement process</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="timeline reveal">
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 01</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Process Discovery</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">We map your current finance, HR and operations workflows and identify highest-impact automation candidates.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 02</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Control Design</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">Chartered Accountants define the control points each bot must respect before a single line of automation is built.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 03</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Bot Development</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">Our engineering team builds, tests and integrates each bot into your existing ERP and communication tools.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 04</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Pilot &amp; Review</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">Bots run in shadow mode alongside your team first, so trust is earned before full handover.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 05</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Go-Live &amp; Monitoring</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">Full production rollout with real-time monitoring dashboards and a 24/7 support desk.</p>
      </div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Related Services</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Pairs well with</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <a href="/erp-automation" class="card card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="3" y="3" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/><rect x="15" y="15" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/><path d="M9 6h6a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v6"/></svg></div><h4>ERP Automation</h4><p>Automate the systems your bots run on top of.</p></a>
    
      <a href="/internal-audit" class="card card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9 8 11 4.6-2 8-6 8-11V5Z"/></svg></div><h4>Internal Audit</h4><p>Continuous assurance over every automated control.</p></a>
    
      <a href="/bi-dashboards" class="card card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><rect x="7" y="12" width="3" height="6"/><rect x="12" y="8" width="3" height="10"/><rect x="17" y="5" width="3" height="13"/></svg></div><h4>BI Dashboards</h4><p>Visualise what your bots are doing in real time.</p></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:840px;">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <div class="eyebrow center" style="justify-content:center;">FAQ</div>
      <h2 class="headline">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-q">Will AI bots replace our finance team? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></div>
        <div class="acc-a"><p>No — bots absorb repetitive, rules-based work so your team can focus on analysis, judgment calls and stakeholder decisions. Every engagement includes upskilling your staff to supervise the automation.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-q">How do you prevent automation errors from compounding? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></div>
        <div class="acc-a"><p>Every bot includes confidence thresholds — transactions below the threshold are routed to a human reviewer instead of being auto-posted, and every action is logged for audit.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-q">Can bots work across multiple entities or currencies? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></div>
        <div class="acc-a"><p>Yes, our bots are built multi-entity and multi-currency from the ground up, a common requirement for our logistics and trading clients.</p></div>
      </div></div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section-tight on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
